💳 Payment Integration

Where payment functionality is enabled, payment-provider integrations should be isolated behind a dedicated abstraction.

Example:
Payment UseCase
      │
      ▼
Payment Repository
      │
      ▼
Payment Provider

This prevents payment-provider implementation details from leaking into UI components.

⚡ Performance

Performance considerations include:

UI
Compose state optimization
Lazy lists
Stable state models
Avoid unnecessary recomposition
Database
Efficient queries
Local-first reads
Indexed fields where appropriate
Network
Avoid duplicate requests
Controlled synchronization
Error-aware retries
AI
Avoid unnecessary AI requests
Cache reusable results where appropriate
Keep AI processing away from the main thread
